  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, heat the sesame oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the grated ginger and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the chicken breast and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken stock cube, date syrup, rice vinegar, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the egg whites and stir until the mixture starts to thicken, about 2 minutes.",
    "Add the toasted sesame seeds, chopped scallions, lemongrass, and cilantro. Stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a serving dish and garnish with additional sesame seeds and scallions if desired."
